Dark grey rails

With this Doc M pack you&rsquo;ll be supplied with four large grab rails and a large hinged support rail. They&rsquo;re all finished in a standout dark grey along with the toilet seat so the user can see exactly where they are. A great contrast for white tiled walls.Steel finished in dark grey epoxy

If you&rsquo;re going to put your whole weight on something to help you stand or sit then you need to know that it&rsquo;s going to be strong. You want to know that it&rsquo;s not made of plastic, that it&rsquo;s durable and it&rsquo;s hardwearing. You want it to be made from steel. This trombone rail is exactly that with an epoxy resin coating for grip and for that stylish dark grey colour.Backrest rail

This pack includes a padded PU backrest rail for added comfort and support whilst using the toilet.Back to wall doc m toiletThis toilet includes a back box in order to comply with Doc M regulations, allowing the toilet to be brought away from the wall. Concealed cistern and spatula lever

This Doc M pack comes with a concealed cistern which gives the bathroom a more spacious feel and frees up space to manouver. It also comes with a&nbsp;spatula lever&nbsp;which has a larger surface area, making&nbsp;it suitable for those who have difficulty using a standard flush lever or button.&nbsp;Wall Hung BasinThis pack benefits from a wall-mounted basin which is crafted from the vitreous china with a glossy white finish. The great thing about wall-mounted basins is that you’re able to choose how high or low you would like to install, allowing you to relieve pressure from having to bend down to wash your hands. This basin includes two tap holes, allowing you to choose where to install the tap so you can have it closer to the toilet.TMV3 valve not included

This pack does not include a TMV3 valve, which is required to comply with Doc M regulations. Thermostatic mixing valves are used to maintain a constant water temperature, to prevent you getting scalded. A TMV3 valve is required to be fitted in public buildings such as hospitals and care homes, to further prevent the risk of scalding. Therefore, if you intend to install this product in a public building you will need to purchase a TMV3 valve separately which can be&nbsp;added to your basket when you checkout.&nbsp;Doc-M CompliantThis product is Doc-M compliant, which stands for Document M.&nbsp;This means that it has been ergonomically built for maximum comfort and conforms with the latest regulations.WRAS Approved for quality

If you&rsquo;re buying any sort of water fitting or product then it&rsquo;s important that its WRAS (Water Regulations Advisory Scheme) approved. It&rsquo;s the best way to work out if that particular product or part complies with the UK requirements for installation within the UK. Key Information:Dark grey rails: Finished in a stylish grey for increased contrast and visibilityStraight grab rail: 5 incredibly durable grab rails&nbsp;includedHinged grab rail: Provide extra support and assistance when using the toiletSteel with epoxy finish: Impressive durability thanks to stainless steel construction and epoxy coatingDoc M approved toilet: Has a taller pan, cistern at a lower level for easy flushingWRAS Approved: Ensures high-quality, complies with the UK requirements for installation within the UKWhat's Included:Fitzroy of London PRO Back to Wall Doc M Toilet Pack &amp; Grey Exposed Fixings Grab Rails DM800K/DGTop Fix Hinge&nbsp;Back box&nbsp;Basin mixer tap&nbsp;Spatula cistern leverLow Level Doc M pan&nbsp;Concealed cistern&nbsp;Extention for spatula lever&nbsp;5 x 600mm&nbsp;grab rails1 x 800mm lift &amp; lock steel hinged railBack rest&nbsp;rail&nbsp;Ring only toilet seat with stainless hingeTwo tap hole basin &amp; fittings&nbsp;Please note: fixings are not included and must be purchased separatelyDark Grey RailsThis Doc M pack includes four large grab rails and a hinged support rail all finished in a standout dark grey for enhanced visibility and style. The matching dark grey toilet seat provides clear contrast against white tiles, ensuring users can easily identify every fixture. Perfect for modern, accessible bathrooms that prioritise safety without compromising on design.Trombone RailWhen it comes to support, strength and reliability are essential. That’s why this trombone rail is made from durable steel, not plastic. Its epoxy resin coating adds a layer of grip and gives it that contemporary dark grey finish, ensuring it’s both practical and stylish.Padded Backrest RailFor extra comfort and stability, this pack includes a padded PU backrest rail — providing gentle support while using the toilet. Designed to make independent living safer and more comfortable.Back to Wall ToiletThe included back-to-wall Doc M toilet comes with a back box to meet full Doc M regulations, allowing the toilet to sit slightly away from the wall. This setup creates more room for grab rails and movement support.Concealed Cistern &amp; Spatula LeverThe concealed cistern helps create a cleaner, more spacious bathroom while providing easier manoeuvrability. The spatula lever flush offers a larger surface area for effortless use, which is ideal for anyone with limited dexterity or hand mobility.Wall Hung BasinCrafted from vitreous china with a glossy white finish, this wall-mounted basin allows you to choose the perfect installation height for your needs. Its two tap holes offer flexibility for tap positioning, making it ideal for easier access beside the toilet.TMV3 Valve (Not Included)This pack does not include a TMV3 thermostatic mixing valve, which is required to maintain a safe, consistent water temperature and prevent scalding. A TMV3 valve is mandatory in public buildings (such as hospitals and care homes) to ensure maximum safety. You can add one to your basket at checkout to meet full compliance.Doc M CompliantThis product is fully Doc M compliant, meaning it’s been ergonomically designed for maximum accessibility, comfort, and safety in accordance with the latest UK building regulations.Trusted Quality AssuranceWRAS (Water Regulations Advisory Scheme) approval guarantees that this product meets strict UK water system standards — giving you peace of mind that it’s safe, compliant, and built to last.Get Yours TodayCreate a safer, more accessible bathroom today. Choose this Doc M dark grey pack for a stylish, regulation-ready solution that puts comfort and safety first!
